            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Updates no longer sign you out.
- This update changes how the app is signed, so macOS may ask you once to allow Marauder Notebook again. Later updates won't ask.
- When you're signed out, the opening screen offers three choices: Sign in, Create an account, or Use without an account.
- When you sign out, Notebook tells you and keeps your notebooks on this Mac. You can sign in again, switch accounts, or keep working.
- From the next update on, What's New shows that update's notes the first time you open Notebook after updating.
]]></description>
